# THIS IS THE FIDELITY ANCHOR for b:vsync gameplay. Unlike every other Get Medieval fixture,
# this capture ran the policy the tree actually ships, so its field and replay lines are
# directly comparable and they agree: the dejitter arm, which is how the stream ran, reads runs
# >= 50 eight against eight, worst 62 against 62, synth 0.8% against 0.8%, over 90 minutes and
# 322658 presents, and the plain replay nine, 60 and 0.9%. That is the evidence the
# replay model tracks this present path on real gameplay, and it is what gm_60x2_gameplay_0917
# cannot give (that one ran the reverted step re-seed rule, so its two lines disagree by
# construction). When the model is doubted, re-measure THIS fixture first.
#
# WHAT IT COVERS that the rest of the corpus does not: 90 minutes of one regime, which is the
# only way to see events that happen a few times an hour. The eight runs >= 50 are the residual
# blend-zone class (item 5, still open after six dead candidate rules): the target crosses the
# blend zone while the lock holds or sweeps, six of the eight sitting at a source rate of 59.7
# to 60.3 per second with the target half a source period from either real frame. max_long_runs
# pins that class at its measured rate, so a lock change that makes it worse fails here.
# It also carries 33 lock engages, the widest sample of the re-engage window in its own regime,
# and none of them is followed by a run >= 50.
#
# WINDOW. Game runs 9 s to 5478 s; the lock finishes acquiring at 50 s and the source goes to
# 240 arrivals/s on the desktop after the exit. Cut 90 s to 5470 s: 40 s of margin at the head,
# 8 s at the tail. Presents are exactly 60/s for every second in the window and no second
# exceeds 130 arrivals, so there is no mid-session desktop excursion or alt-tab inside it.
# The video pairs with this log at log time = video time + 48.676 s (marker counter 2919 at
# video frame 0), cross-checked at 99.93% provenance agreement over the marked span.
#
# Bounds on the REPLAY (not the field): inequalities, so an improvement passes and only a
